    "detailed_description": "Make money by creating zombies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLiliane, a girl who wants to be a necromancer, creates lots of zombies to earn money to be recognized by her demon lord daddy.<br />\r\nIn the morning she has time to work and in the afternoon she has free time.<br />\r\nSometimes she will mess around with zombies and wolf boys to make boyfriends.<br />\r\nWill you be able to accumulate enough money in a short period of time to become a full-fledged necromancer?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a simple simulation game.<br />\r\nMouse operation is the main.<br />\r\nThere are some elements of Otome game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEstimated playing time: 30 min.<br />\r\nNumber of characters: 6<br />\r\nED: 6~",
